4. DIAGRAMAS GENERADOS (FORMATO TEXTUAL)
============================================================
4.1 Diagrama de contexto (C4-Context simplificado)

[Estudiante] ----> |
[Profesor]   ----> | Frontend Next.js (roles, UI, chat)
[Admin]      ----> |
                     |
                     v
                Backend Spring Boot API
                     |
         +-----------+-----------+
         |                       |
         v                       v
   PostgreSQL                APIs externas
 (usuarios, casos,          (PubMed, Europe PMC,
  busquedas, logs)           ClinicalTrials)

4.2 Diagrama de casos de uso (resumen)
- Actor Estudiante:
  Buscar evidencia, Verificar claim/URL, Generar bibliografia, Resolver casos, Chatear.
- Actor Profesor:
  Gestionar casos, Evaluar entregas, Gestionar hedges, Ver analiticas, Buscar, Chatear.
- Actor Administrador:
  Gestionar usuarios, Auditar, Configurar sistema, Monitorear salud/APIs, Mantenimiento, Chatear.

4.3 Diagrama de componentes (alto nivel)

Frontend
- app/student/*
- app/professor/*
- app/admin/*
- components/*
- hooks/*
- contexts/auth-context

Backend API
- Auth + Security JWT
- Search/Verification/Bibliography
- Cases/Evaluations
- Admin/Audit/System/Health
- Chat REST + WebSocket

Integraciones
- PubMed
- Europe PMC
- ClinicalTrials.gov

Persistencia
- users, competency_progress
- search_sessions, search_results
- verification_results
- case_studies, case_submissions
- system_logs, chat_messages

4.4 Diagrama de secuencia: busqueda avanzada estudiante

Estudiante -> Frontend: Define query + filtros
Frontend -> /api/search/execute: POST SearchRequest
Backend -> Proveedor externo(s): Consultar evidencia
Proveedor externo(s) -> Backend: Resultados
Backend -> DB: Guardar search_session + resultados
Backend -> Frontend: SearchResponse
Frontend -> Estudiante: Mostrar resultados + opcion guardar

4.5 Diagrama de secuencia: monitor de APIs externas (admin)

Admin -> Frontend Admin: Ejecutar diagnostico
Frontend -> /api/admin/external-apis/check: POST query
Backend -> PubMed: test query
Backend -> Europe PMC: test query
Backend -> ClinicalTrials: test query
Backend -> Frontend: estado por proveedor + latencia + cobertura
Frontend -> Admin: tablero de diagnostico

4.6 Diagrama entidad-relacion (conceptual)

users (1) ---- (0..1) students
users (1) ---- (0..1) professors
users (1) ---- (0..1) administrators

users (1) ---- (N) search_sessions ---- (N) search_results
users (1) ---- (N) verification_results

professors (1) ---- (N) case_studies ---- (N) case_submissions ---- (N) students
case_studies (1) ---- (N) case_guiding_questions

users (1) ---- (N) system_logs
users (1) ---- (N) chat_messages (como sender/recipient)

4.7 Diagrama de despliegue (logico)

[Navegador]
   |
   v
[Next.js App (Puerto 3000)]
   |
   v
[Spring Boot API (Puerto 8080)] ---- [WebSocket endpoint]
   |
   +---- [PostgreSQL]
   |
   +---- [PubMed / Europe PMC / ClinicalTrials APIs]

